OL,3,GNEWSA'How are we expected to pay for
OL,4,Ait?': Drivers' fears as fuel prices
OL,5,Asoar
OL,6,
OL,7,FSoaring fuel prices are forcing
OL,8,Fmotorists to cut back on everyday
OL,9,Fspending and adding tens of thousands
OL,10,Fof pounds a week to business costs,
OL,11,Fwith petrol at its highest level since
OL,12,FNovember 2022.
OL,14,FDrivers say they are changing their
OL,15,Fspending habits to cope with rising
OL,16,Fcosts at the pump, while businesses
OL,17,Fwarn higher fuel bills are placing
OL,18,Fincreasing pressure on their finances.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
