OL,3,GNEWSA'How are we expected to pay for
OL,4,Ait?': Drivers' fears as fuel prices
OL,5,Asoar
OL,6,
OL,7,FPetrol prices rose to an average of
OL,8,F161.3p per litre between July and
OL,9,FAugust, according to the Office for
OL,10,FNational Statistics (ONS), the highest
OL,11,Flevel recorded since November 2022,
OL,12,Fwhen Russia's invasion of Ukraine
OL,13,Fpushed up global energy costs.
OL,15,FDiesel is also expected to top #2 per
OL,16,Flitre in the coming days.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
